{"ref":"BDB, חֵ֫פֶר","hw":"חֵ֫פֶר","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֵ֫פֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a Manassite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:32\" href=\"/Numbers.26.32\">Nu 26:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:33\" href=\"/Numbers.26.33\">33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:1\" href=\"/Numbers.27.1\">27:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:2\" href=\"/Joshua.17.2\">Jos 17:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:3\" href=\"/Joshua.17.3\">3</a>, 𝔊 Οφερ.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a man of Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.6\">1 Ch 4:6</a>; 𝔊 Ηφαλ, 𝔊L Αφερ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  one of David’s heroes, according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.36\">1 Ch 11:36</a> (but on text v. Be VB and Dr <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.36\">2 S 23:36</a>).","next":"BDB, חֶפְרִי","prev":"BDB, חָפַר"}